==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*aldas}}, a Germanic loan from {{der|fi|gem-pro|*aldǭ||trough}} (whence e.g. {{cog|no|olda}}). The ending has probably been modified to {{m|fi||-as}} by analogy with other Germanic loans (such as {{m|fi|valas}}). {{cog|krl|allaš||trough}} is of the same origin. Doublet with {{m|fi|aalto}}.

